GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":2773630,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-2773630","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T07:33:11Z","value":53,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4699340","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-2773630-1846651706685916","game_id":"steam-2773630","kind":"update","title":"Demo update v0.0.88","summary":"FixesDashing through enemies no longer cuts the dash short or shoves the mech.The language list shows each language in its own name.Upgrade boxes are easier to pick up.Menu and gameplay text fits the screen better.The shop reroll button only shows when there is something to buy.Shops Menus no longer break when they open with no items.ChangesTraditional Chinese added.Evolved weapons show an Evolution tag.Parts explode with less force.Box contact areas are bigger now","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T01:17:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685916","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2773630-1846651706678664","game_id":"steam-2773630","kind":"announcement","title":"Iron Hunters Demo Is OUT NOW! Build Your War Machine!","summary":"Hunters, it's time to suit up! The free Iron Hunters Demo is officially LIVE on Steam! First, a huge thank you to everyone who joined our previous Playtest. Your feedback, suggestions, and support have been incredibly valuable as we continue developing the game. Now it's time to open the cockpit to even more Hunters! Build a War Machine. Break the Run. Iron Hunters is a fast-paced survivor-like where you pilot customizable mechs, combine powerful weapons, and fight your way through relentless ho","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T17:02:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706678664","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2773630-1846018067926362","game_id":"steam-2773630","kind":"announcement","title":"Iron Hunters Demo Launches October 15!","summary":"Hunters, The wait is almost over. The Iron Hunters Demo will officially launch on Steam on: October 15 at 10:00 AM PDT / 1:00 PM EDT After our first Playtest, we’ve been working through your feedback and continuing to improve the combat, balance, and overall experience. Now, it’s almost time to get back into the cockpit. In Iron Hunters, you’ll pilot customizable mechs through chaotic bullet-hell battles across alien worlds. Upgrade, evolve, and combine weapons during each run, discover powerful","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T14:38:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067926362","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2773630-1846018067924400","game_id":"steam-2773630","kind":"update","title":"Demo update v0.0.87","summary":"GameplayContact pushes stop at rocks instead of pushing the mech through them.Dashes stop at rocks instead of moving the mech through them.OthersMinor UI/UX improvements and text corrections.Minor audio and VFX fixes.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T22:33:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067924400","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2773630-1845383656376644","game_id":"steam-2773630","kind":"update","title":"Demo update v0.0.85","summary":"MenuNew main menu animations and ships. Stars and the station visuals were updated.On first launch you can allow or decline anonymous analytics. Nothing is collected until you allow it. You can change this later under Settings → Allow analytics.HangarModular Chassis unlocks level growth and special skills on the equipped Core and Drive Unit. Until you buy it, those bonuses stay gray in the hangar and do not apply during a run.Viper Cores 0000, 0001, and 0002 gain one microchip slot (2 → 3). The ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T07:51:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656376644","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2773630-1843481262688432","game_id":"steam-2773630","kind":"announcement","title":"The Iron Hunters Playtest Has Ended","summary":"Hunters, thank you for all your support! The first Iron Hunters Playtest has now officially ended. Throughout the test, we received a lot of valuable feedback, suggestions, and gameplay data. We’ll now review everything we learned and continue improving the combat, balance, and overall experience. Once these improvements are ready, our next step will be to officially release the Iron Hunters Demo and open the game to even more players. Thank you again to everyone who joined the Playtest. If you ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T08:45:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262688432","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2773630-1842212951310170","game_id":"steam-2773630","kind":"announcement","title":"The First Iron Hunters Playtest Is Now Live!","summary":"Hunters, it’s time to get into the cockpit. We’re excited to announce that the first-ever Iron Hunters Playtest is now officially live! Starting today, you can visit the Iron Hunters Steam store page and click “Request Access” to sign up for the Playtest. This is our first public testing phase, and we’re looking forward to finally putting the game into your hands. How Long Will the Playtest Last? We currently expect this Playtest to run for approximately 10 days. However, since this is our first","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T13:13:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951310170","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2773630-1825727806718246","game_id":"steam-2773630","kind":"announcement","title":"Iron Hunters at Rogue Bots 2026!","summary":"Iron Hunters is officially part of Rogue Bots 2026 on Steam! 🤖🔥This event celebrates robotic destruction, mechanical chaos, and high-intensity combat and Iron Hunters fits right in.If you enjoy:• Fast-paced action combat • Tactical decision-making • Powerful robotic enemies • Intense survival encountersThen Iron Hunters is built for you.Add Iron Hunters to your Wishlist today!Thank you for being part of the journey, more updates are coming soon! The other developers also have their own games ava","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-02T17:45:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825727806718246","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2773630":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:19:51Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:19:51Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_